1
00:01:27,220 --> 00:01:29,740
[Episode 32]

2
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:32,960
[A few months later]

3
00:01:57,780 --> 00:01:59,360
Don't move.

4
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:10,200
You look handsome.

5
00:02:11,580 --> 00:02:14,620
Why does this feel like we're getting married?

6
00:02:14,620 --> 00:02:16,640
Nervous?

7
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:18,720
I've waited a long time for this.

8
00:02:23,900 --> 00:02:26,060
Does it still hurt?

9
00:02:37,060 --> 00:02:38,641
Let's go.

10
00:02:52,640 --> 00:02:54,740
The court is now in session.

11
00:02:54,740 --> 00:02:55,820
[Witness]

12
00:02:56,660 --> 00:03:00,760
In 2005, Zhai Feng Mao forced me
across the border.

13
00:03:00,760 --> 00:03:04,200
In 2006, he sold me to Kao,
a man from Country Jin.

14
00:03:04,200 --> 00:03:05,866
I was put to work on the border.

15
00:03:05,866 --> 00:03:10,260
In 2008, the police helped me return home.

16
00:03:10,260 --> 00:03:16,080
In 2005, I was admitted to Jiaohai University,
but lost contact with my closest family.

17
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:21,340
In 2011,
I went back to Teng City for audit work.

18
00:03:21,340 --> 00:03:25,800
During the audit,
I uncovered Zhang Bin's crimes.

19
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:28,580
As an auditor for Mingtong and Associates,

20
00:03:28,580 --> 00:03:32,340
and in accordance with national professional
standards and auditing requirements,

21
00:03:32,340 --> 00:03:36,060
I confirm the following statements
and materials are true and accurate.

22
00:03:36,060 --> 00:03:37,620
The verdict will now be announced.

23
00:03:37,620 --> 00:03:39,740
All rise.

24
00:03:41,640 --> 00:03:43,187
[Defendant]

25
00:03:46,140 --> 00:03:50,319
Based on the evidence submitted
by the prosecution and its arguments,

26
00:03:50,319 --> 00:03:51,719
this court rules as follows.

27
00:03:51,719 --> 00:03:54,900
The defendants, Zhang Bin and Tao Jiang,

28
00:03:54,900 --> 00:04:00,322
violated customs laws,
evaded customs supervision,

29
00:04:00,322 --> 00:04:06,800
and jointly smuggled germanium,
a rare metal banned from import and export.

30
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:10,039
The offense was serious
and caused grave harm to society.

31
00:04:10,039 --> 00:04:12,719
Their actions violated criminal law

32
00:04:12,719 --> 00:04:13,960
and constituted the crime of

33
00:04:13,960 --> 00:04:17,420
smuggling goods and items banned
from import and export.

34
00:04:17,420 --> 00:04:19,259
They shall be punished according to the law.

35
00:04:19,259 --> 00:04:26,040
In this joint crime, defendant Zhang Bin
planned and directly carried out the smuggling,

36
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:29,920
played a leading role,
and was the principal offender.

37
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:32,220
Defendant Tao Jiang

38
00:04:32,220 --> 00:04:36,220
acted under Zhang Bin's direction
and assisted with transportation.

39
00:04:36,220 --> 00:04:40,480
He played a supporting role
and was an accomplice.

40
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:45,782
Based on the criminal facts
and the nature and circumstances

41
00:04:45,782 --> 00:04:49,880
of the crimes committed
by Zhang Bin and Tao Jiang,

42
00:04:49,880 --> 00:04:55,020
under the Criminal Law of
the People's Republic of China

43
00:04:55,020 --> 00:04:57,500
and relevant provisions,
the verdict is as follows.

44
00:04:57,500 --> 00:04:59,199
Defendant Zhang Bin

45
00:04:59,199 --> 00:05:04,180
is guilty of smuggling goods and items
banned from import or export by the state,

46
00:05:04,180 --> 00:05:08,120
arson, and attempted intentional homicide.

47
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:10,020
For multiple offenses,

48
00:05:10,020 --> 00:05:15,319
he is sentenced to life imprisonment
and deprived of political rights for life.

49
00:05:20,180 --> 00:05:22,140
Defendant Tao Jiang

50
00:05:22,140 --> 00:05:26,920
is guilty of smuggling goods and items
banned from import or export by the state.

51
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:30,780
He is sentenced to eight years in prison.

52
00:05:30,780 --> 00:05:35,819
Regarding the 2005 Teng City arson case
that killed public officials

53
00:05:35,819 --> 00:05:38,220
and the Kuangxia Group pyramid scheme case,

54
00:05:38,220 --> 00:05:42,160
defendant Zhai Feng Mao is now in custody.

55
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:44,980
Given the severity and multiple offenses,

56
00:05:44,980 --> 00:05:50,240
he is sentenced to life imprisonment
and deprived of political rights for life.

57
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:51,940
That concludes the verdict.

58
00:05:51,940 --> 00:05:53,600
Court is adjourned.

59
00:05:56,160 --> 00:06:01,953
[Chen Yi is found guilty
of smuggling as an accomplice,]

60
00:06:01,953 --> 00:06:07,746
[but his role and harm were minor.]

61
00:06:07,746 --> 00:06:13,540
[Given his surrender and cooperation,
he's exempted from punishment and admonished.]

62
00:07:02,640 --> 00:07:06,900
I still have a few days of leave.
Take care of your own business.

63
00:07:06,900 --> 00:07:09,240
[To-Do List]
[Have dinner with Bo, Qiao, and Tu Li]

64
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:11,720
[Have dinner with Bo, Qiao, and Tu Li]

65
00:07:27,319 --> 00:07:28,900
Once everything's settled,

66
00:07:28,900 --> 00:07:33,920
let's invite Uncle Zhou, Bo,
Yong, and Tu Li over for dinner.

67
00:07:39,720 --> 00:07:42,820
You left everything behind. What about me?

68
00:07:42,820 --> 00:07:45,720
Come with me. What else?

69
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:49,520
Where are you whisking me off to?

70
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:54,760
We'll roam the world and call it home.

71
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:10,360
Miao Jing.

72
00:08:11,060 --> 00:08:13,380
You said it yourself.

73
00:08:13,380 --> 00:08:15,800
You said you'd take me with you.

74
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:17,800
Then it's settled.

75
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:20,080
Neither of us leaves the other behind.

76
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:23,301
Okay?

77
00:08:37,980 --> 00:08:39,661
Hang it up.

78
00:08:41,759 --> 00:08:43,780
Not with that.

79
00:08:44,500 --> 00:08:46,379
[Have dinner with Bo, Qiao, and Tu Li]
Then, how am I supposed to reach?

80
00:08:46,379 --> 00:08:49,100
Do it the way I did.

81
00:08:49,100 --> 00:08:51,720
Like this?

82
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:11,961
Yong, what are you cutting?

83
00:09:14,500 --> 00:09:16,100
This guy can't cook.

84
00:09:16,100 --> 00:09:18,299
Unbelievable.

85
00:09:18,299 --> 00:09:20,640
You should put this in first.

86
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:29,140
Yong.

87
00:09:29,140 --> 00:09:31,440
Maybe we should stop cutting.

88
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:34,019
Isn't this fine?

89
00:09:34,019 --> 00:09:35,419
It looks pretty good.

90
00:09:35,419 --> 00:09:37,460
Yi, this is...

91
00:09:40,740 --> 00:09:42,747
Don't move. Don't do it like that.

92
00:09:42,747 --> 00:09:45,740
Where's your nail clipper? I'll do it.
Don't pull it with your hand.

93
00:09:45,740 --> 00:09:48,380
It's in there. The pink one.

94
00:09:48,380 --> 00:09:50,320
Don't move.

95
00:09:54,100 --> 00:09:55,660
Can you squeeze it out?

96
00:09:55,660 --> 00:09:58,300
Yes. Don't move. Let me see.

97
00:10:00,620 --> 00:10:01,840
It's out.

98
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:03,400
All better?

99
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:18,683
Hello, Uncle Zhou.

100
00:10:18,683 --> 00:10:21,440
We're making hot pot tonight.
Want to come over?

101
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:23,620
<i>No, you go ahead.</i>

102
00:10:23,620 --> 00:10:26,680
You young people can't relax when I'm there.

103
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:34,240
- Mr. Zhou.
- I'm here to pick up my clothes.

104
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:36,540
Sure. Just a moment, please.

105
00:12:37,487 --> 00:12:39,808
What are your plans now?

106
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:43,919
I want to reopen the pool hall.

107
00:12:43,919 --> 00:12:45,080
I'm not good at much.

108
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:48,500
I've been around pool halls with you
since I was a kid, making a living.

109
00:12:48,500 --> 00:12:51,159
And my old students are still waiting
to come back for lessons.

110
00:12:51,159 --> 00:12:54,100
Right. The exterior walls need repainting, too.
It's been delayed for ages.

111
00:12:54,100 --> 00:12:56,019
I've spent the past few days
at the building materials market.

112
00:12:56,019 --> 00:12:57,899
It took forever
to finally settle on the materials.

113
00:12:57,899 --> 00:12:59,700
It's such a pain to shop there.

114
00:12:59,700 --> 00:13:02,540
Before we leave, Yi can still help out.

115
00:13:02,540 --> 00:13:04,560
You know how to do that too?

116
00:13:04,560 --> 00:13:06,960
I'm great at skim-coating walls.

117
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:11,240
Back when Miao Jing was in school,
I took every job I could get.

118
00:13:14,659 --> 00:13:17,440
So...

119
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:21,120
you two already bought your tickets?

120
00:13:21,120 --> 00:13:23,100
We fly to Hai City this weekend.

121
00:13:24,820 --> 00:13:27,740
Don't come see us off.
No need to make a thing of it.

122
00:13:27,740 --> 00:13:29,640
You know...

123
00:13:30,380 --> 00:13:32,480
you only just came back.

124
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:34,240
It hasn't been that long.

125
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:38,480
I haven't even been with you long.
And now you're leaving again.

126
00:13:40,460 --> 00:13:42,560
It's not like I'm never coming back.

127
00:13:42,560 --> 00:13:44,940
I'll be back for New Year's, won't I?

128
00:13:44,940 --> 00:13:49,000
Sometimes I don't know how to say what I feel.

129
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:51,840
But after all these years,
you mean so much to me.

130
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:54,080
I just really hate to leave you.

131
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:55,840
- Drop the act.
- What am I supposed to do when you're gone?

132
00:13:55,840 --> 00:13:56,980
Knock it off.

133
00:13:56,980 --> 00:13:58,200
I'm not drinking with him.

134
00:13:58,200 --> 00:13:59,639
Who taught you that?
If not with him, how about with me?

135
00:13:59,639 --> 00:14:00,799
- I'll drink with you.
- Come on.

136
00:14:00,799 --> 00:14:01,820
- I'll drink with you.
- Come on.

137
00:14:01,820 --> 00:14:03,620
- Come on.
- Cheers.

138
00:14:07,920 --> 00:14:10,640
- What about you?
- Me?

139
00:14:10,640 --> 00:14:13,600
Same as always. My place is doing fine.

140
00:14:13,600 --> 00:14:17,259
But I'm thinking of hiring someone
so I can spend more time with Bao.

141
00:14:17,259 --> 00:14:19,980
We'll see when the time comes.
It's not set in stone.

142
00:14:20,740 --> 00:14:24,160
There's one more classic bit.
Do you guys want to see it?

143
00:14:24,160 --> 00:14:26,240
- What is it?
- Here's the thing.

144
00:14:26,240 --> 00:14:31,240
For this bittersweet farewell,
I prepared a song for all of you.

145
00:14:32,779 --> 00:14:34,679
It goes like this.

146
00:14:34,679 --> 00:14:36,600
Listen up.

147
00:14:39,820 --> 00:14:41,799
Don't look at me. Just eat.

148
00:14:41,799 --> 00:14:45,740
Just think of me as some lounge singer.

149
00:14:47,159 --> 00:14:50,419
<i>♪ Beyond the long pavilion ♪</i>

150
00:14:50,419 --> 00:14:53,820
<i>♪ Beside the ancient road ♪</i>

151
00:14:53,820 --> 00:14:55,340
<i>♪ The grass-- ♪</i>

152
00:14:56,000 --> 00:15:00,800
<i>♪ The grass stretches green to the horizon ♪</i>

153
00:15:02,160 --> 00:15:07,980
<i>♪ The evening breeze brushes the willows,
and the flute fades ♪</i>

154
00:15:07,980 --> 00:15:12,360
<i>♪ The sunset sinks beyond the hills ♪</i>

155
00:15:12,360 --> 00:15:13,460
- Come on, cheers.
- Not bad, right?

156
00:15:13,460 --> 00:15:15,860
- Am I good? Cheers!
- Absolutely! Cheers!

157
00:15:15,860 --> 00:15:18,640
Cheers!

158
00:17:12,500 --> 00:17:14,061
Wen.

159
00:17:15,119 --> 00:17:17,500
I've got good news.

160
00:17:18,640 --> 00:17:20,579
Zhang Bin was sentenced.

161
00:17:20,579 --> 00:17:22,599
He got the maximum penalty.

162
00:17:22,599 --> 00:17:25,000
Zhai Feng Mao has been arrested, too.

163
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:29,380
It's all over.

164
00:17:30,180 --> 00:17:34,000
[Tomb of My Beloved Wife, He Wen Jie]
Chen Yi and Miao Jing came to see you, right?

165
00:17:34,839 --> 00:17:38,560
This time, we owe it all to them.

166
00:17:39,940 --> 00:17:43,660
Chen Yi is old enough to know better.

167
00:17:43,660 --> 00:17:48,119
[Tomb of My Beloved Wife, He Wen Jie]
But sometimes he still acts too rashly.

168
00:17:51,960 --> 00:17:54,660
Good thing Jing keeps him in line.

169
00:17:55,460 --> 00:17:57,799
Jing is impressive now.

170
00:17:57,799 --> 00:18:01,539
She's the most educated one of us.

171
00:18:01,539 --> 00:18:02,880
A top-tier university graduate.

172
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:05,220
A senior auditor.

173
00:18:10,880 --> 00:18:15,400
The two of them should be on the plane now.

174
00:18:16,680 --> 00:18:19,441
They'll settle down in Hai City.

175
00:18:22,300 --> 00:18:24,140
That's good.

176
00:18:25,400 --> 00:18:27,220
I wish them the best.

177
00:18:48,019 --> 00:18:50,420
It's all over.

178
00:19:38,580 --> 00:19:44,120
[Hai City]

179
00:19:56,500 --> 00:20:01,140
When you're at work, what can I do at home?

180
00:20:02,420 --> 00:20:04,600
Do your laundry and cook for you?

181
00:20:05,657 --> 00:20:07,957
Of course.

182
00:20:18,740 --> 00:20:20,801
It feels like back then.

183
00:20:21,480 --> 00:20:23,480
Back when?

184
00:20:25,100 --> 00:20:28,500
One year, you came out of the bus station.

185
00:20:28,500 --> 00:20:31,320
I rode my motorcycle and took you home.

186
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:35,480
I remember riding for a long time that day.

187
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:39,240
Then you fell asleep on my back.

188
00:20:44,779 --> 00:20:47,120
That was ages ago.

189
00:20:48,120 --> 00:20:49,720
Yeah.

190
00:20:58,060 --> 00:21:00,721
Look at the sunset.

191
00:21:16,100 --> 00:21:18,960
[Mingtong Audit Firm]

192
00:21:37,740 --> 00:21:38,900
Miao.

193
00:21:38,900 --> 00:21:42,260
No wonder you looked so familiar.

194
00:21:42,260 --> 00:21:45,740
I heard Mr. Cen got sent out again.

195
00:21:45,740 --> 00:21:49,080
He was transferred back under two months ago.
Why send him away again?

196
00:21:49,080 --> 00:21:50,860
It was headquarters' decision.

197
00:21:50,860 --> 00:21:53,880
If you want to travel with him,
you can apply for it.

198
00:21:53,880 --> 00:21:55,960
That's above my pay grade.

199
00:21:55,960 --> 00:22:00,120
Headquarters never issued a notice
on the Haoyun project.

200
00:22:00,120 --> 00:22:03,600
Wasn't that because Mr. Cen
shut it down by force

201
00:22:03,600 --> 00:22:07,220
and Hongshen wasn't happy,
so they buried it. Right?

202
00:22:07,220 --> 00:22:09,099
You know quite a bit.

203
00:22:09,099 --> 00:22:12,200
Monica really stuck her neck out for you.

204
00:22:12,200 --> 00:22:15,940
You were demoted for dealing
with Haoyun off the books.

205
00:22:15,940 --> 00:22:18,059
[Mingtong Audit, Junior Auditor, Ding Lei]

206
00:22:18,059 --> 00:22:20,780
But it doesn't seem to have affected you.

207
00:22:24,339 --> 00:22:27,000
Ms. Miao, do you need help moving your stuff?

208
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:30,640
Why are you moving desks? Right.

209
00:22:30,640 --> 00:22:34,880
Mr. Cen got sent away,
and now his people are out in the cold.

210
00:22:34,880 --> 00:22:37,000
That's office politics for you.

211
00:22:38,560 --> 00:22:41,180
Ms. Miao is getting a private office.

212
00:22:41,180 --> 00:22:42,580
You didn't know?

213
00:22:42,580 --> 00:22:44,200
A private office?

214
00:22:44,200 --> 00:22:45,720
Why?

215
00:22:45,720 --> 00:22:48,559
Because our team avoided the risk in time

216
00:22:48,559 --> 00:22:51,920
and minimized the losses
for the company and Hongshen.

217
00:22:51,920 --> 00:22:55,640
And for your information,
we found Haoyun is suspected of smuggling.

218
00:22:55,640 --> 00:23:00,079
For the next two months, they have to assist
the Teng City and Lingang police.

219
00:23:00,079 --> 00:23:04,759
So neither the company
nor Hongshen can provide notarization.

220
00:23:04,759 --> 00:23:11,640
The detailed audit notice on Haoyun
will be posted on the company intranet.

221
00:23:11,640 --> 00:23:17,360
As for my promotion notice,
go check it yourselves.

222
00:23:17,360 --> 00:23:19,960
Mr. Junior Auditor, step aside.

223
00:23:22,079 --> 00:23:26,180
Tell new team members about the dinner tonight,
so everyone can mingle.

224
00:23:26,180 --> 00:23:27,240
Dinner? Sure.

225
00:23:27,240 --> 00:23:28,960
Okay.

226
00:23:30,200 --> 00:23:34,340
- She really got promoted?
- Of course. Why would I lie to you?

227
00:23:34,340 --> 00:23:35,340
[Notice of Ms. Miao Jing's Promotion]

228
00:23:36,960 --> 00:23:39,019
- It's real!
- Unbelievable.

229
00:23:39,019 --> 00:23:41,559
- That's amazing.
- Jing really got promoted.

230
00:23:41,559 --> 00:23:43,880
Let's all have dinner tonight. I thought.

231
00:23:43,880 --> 00:23:45,079
Right. We haven't gone out in ages.

232
00:23:45,079 --> 00:23:46,259
- Tonight, we definitely have to...
- What are we eating?

233
00:23:46,259 --> 00:23:49,260
- What should we get? The same place?
- Hot pot.

234
00:24:00,599 --> 00:24:03,279
This is pretty good.

235
00:24:03,279 --> 00:24:05,120
The portion is pretty good.

236
00:24:07,319 --> 00:24:08,460
Perfect, all the dishes are here.

237
00:24:08,460 --> 00:24:12,000
Come on, let's raise our glasses
and congratulate Jing.

238
00:24:12,000 --> 00:24:13,920
- Congratulations, Jing.
- Congratulations, Jing.

239
00:24:13,920 --> 00:24:14,980
- Thank you.
- Cheers.

240
00:24:14,980 --> 00:24:16,960
- Here we go.
- Congrats on the promotion.

241
00:24:16,960 --> 00:24:19,319
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

242
00:24:19,319 --> 00:24:23,559
I have been waiting for Jing
to treat us to this meal forever.

243
00:24:23,559 --> 00:24:25,599
Us too. Exactly.

244
00:24:25,599 --> 00:24:29,279
I'm Ma Yang, from Cen's audit team.
Let's keep in touch at work.

245
00:24:29,279 --> 00:24:30,799
- Sure.
- Come on.

246
00:24:30,799 --> 00:24:32,480
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

247
00:24:32,480 --> 00:24:34,320
Cheers.

248
00:24:34,320 --> 00:24:36,240
- Eat up, everyone.
- Come on, eat.

249
00:24:36,240 --> 00:24:37,799
I was starving.

250
00:24:37,799 --> 00:24:39,920
- Want some?
- It smells great. This is good.

251
00:24:39,920 --> 00:24:42,380
This one's good, too.

252
00:24:44,920 --> 00:24:47,539
- Hello?
<i>- Where are you?</i>

253
00:24:47,539 --> 00:24:52,079
I'm at Huamao, having dinner with coworkers.
Don't wait for me for dinner.

254
00:24:52,079 --> 00:24:56,720
I'm at Huamao too.
I can come pick you up on my way.

255
00:24:57,319 --> 00:24:59,900
We're on the first floor.

256
00:25:00,720 --> 00:25:03,180
Do you want to join us?

257
00:25:03,180 --> 00:25:04,740
Sure.

258
00:25:09,500 --> 00:25:13,020
Jing brought someone back from her trip?

259
00:25:13,020 --> 00:25:15,166
A six-foot-three total hunk.

260
00:25:15,166 --> 00:25:18,240
She's got incredible taste.

261
00:25:18,240 --> 00:25:19,841
I see.

262
00:25:26,700 --> 00:25:28,580
Here!

263
00:25:29,359 --> 00:25:31,840
- There he is!
- Six-foot-three.

264
00:25:32,500 --> 00:25:34,180
So this is Jing's boyfriend.

265
00:25:34,180 --> 00:25:35,220
Great taste. He's so handsome.

266
00:25:35,220 --> 00:25:37,559
They're your coworkers.

267
00:25:37,559 --> 00:25:38,960
Is it okay for me to join?

268
00:25:38,960 --> 00:25:40,000
Of course.

269
00:25:40,000 --> 00:25:41,599
- Totally appropriate.
- Make some room for Chen Yi.

270
00:25:41,599 --> 00:25:42,599
Come on, have a seat.

271
00:25:42,599 --> 00:25:44,440
Sit down.

272
00:25:45,599 --> 00:25:48,819
Server, another set of utensils, please.

273
00:25:48,819 --> 00:25:51,660
Hi, everyone. I'm Chen Yi.

274
00:25:51,660 --> 00:25:53,920
Miao Jing's boyfriend.

275
00:25:55,740 --> 00:25:59,420
Chen, now that you're in Hai City,
are you leaving again?

276
00:25:59,420 --> 00:26:00,500
No.

277
00:26:00,500 --> 00:26:02,079
I'm staying with her from now on.

278
00:26:02,079 --> 00:26:04,619
Then let's get together more often.

279
00:26:04,619 --> 00:26:06,839
That's so romantic.

280
00:26:06,839 --> 00:26:08,200
- Eat up.
- Go on, eat.

281
00:26:08,200 --> 00:26:10,140
- Thank you.
- Have some more.

282
00:26:11,839 --> 00:26:13,980
- The mutton is delicious.
- Eat, eat.

283
00:26:15,099 --> 00:26:16,519
Have some more.

284
00:26:16,519 --> 00:26:19,119
Have you set the date yet?

285
00:26:19,119 --> 00:26:20,759
What day is it?

286
00:26:20,759 --> 00:26:22,920
Your wedding day.

287
00:26:26,440 --> 00:26:28,539
No way.

288
00:26:28,539 --> 00:26:32,680
You two are head over heels,
and you've never thought about that?

289
00:26:33,420 --> 00:26:37,240
That's Jing and Chen's private business.

290
00:26:37,240 --> 00:26:39,500
Eat up.

291
00:26:39,500 --> 00:26:41,520
Why so many questions?

292
00:26:43,400 --> 00:26:46,220
This doesn't taste good.

293
00:26:46,220 --> 00:26:48,560
Drink something warm. You're on your period.

294
00:26:50,319 --> 00:26:53,400
You need to take good care of Jing.

295
00:26:53,400 --> 00:26:56,940
A lot of guys at the office are into her.

296
00:26:58,220 --> 00:27:00,400
Then she has good taste.

297
00:27:00,400 --> 00:27:02,540
True.

298
00:27:08,380 --> 00:27:10,480
What else do we need at home?

299
00:27:11,860 --> 00:27:13,600
Noodles.

300
00:27:15,100 --> 00:27:16,920
Have this.

301
00:27:27,206 --> 00:27:28,760
I need to buy more food.

302
00:27:28,760 --> 00:27:30,800
What we ordered earlier wasn't enough.

303
00:27:30,800 --> 00:27:34,440
If you weren't full,
why didn't you order another dish?

304
00:27:34,440 --> 00:27:36,780
88 yuan for one dish? That's insane.

305
00:27:36,780 --> 00:27:39,060
Barely enough for one bite each.

306
00:27:39,060 --> 00:27:41,440
How are you so frugal?

307
00:27:41,440 --> 00:27:43,180
You've been here over two months.

308
00:27:43,180 --> 00:27:46,600
Aside from your spending money,
you haven't asked me for anything else.

309
00:27:48,259 --> 00:27:51,400
You don't know how expensive life is
until you run a home.

310
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:53,000
You're the one supporting me now.

311
00:27:53,000 --> 00:27:56,740
I'm the house husband,
so of course I worry about that.

312
00:27:57,380 --> 00:27:59,480
Let's go, house husband.

313
00:28:08,360 --> 00:28:10,319
When are you going to buy a car?

314
00:28:10,319 --> 00:28:13,700
Riding a motorcycle is inconvenient
in wind and rain.

315
00:28:13,700 --> 00:28:15,900
We only just moved in, didn't we?

316
00:28:15,900 --> 00:28:18,480
We're not fully settled yet.

317
00:28:18,480 --> 00:28:21,200
Let's wait a little longer.

318
00:28:59,500 --> 00:29:02,460
Are you bored staying home?

319
00:29:02,460 --> 00:29:04,280
Not really.

320
00:29:09,380 --> 00:29:12,900
You don't have to slave away at the office,
and you don't know anyone here.

321
00:29:12,900 --> 00:29:15,700
I bet you're bored out of your mind.

322
00:29:17,300 --> 00:29:19,880
Feel free to check if I'm out of my mind.

323
00:29:20,840 --> 00:29:23,180
Are you having a hard time adjusting here?

324
00:29:23,180 --> 00:29:26,740
New place, no one you know.

325
00:29:29,240 --> 00:29:33,120
If you're going to say that,
you might as well hear me out.

326
00:29:33,860 --> 00:29:35,740
Go on.

327
00:29:39,840 --> 00:29:41,421
Actually,

328
00:29:42,300 --> 00:29:45,460
I looked for you when I first got back
from Country Jin.

329
00:29:45,460 --> 00:29:47,539
Back in college.

330
00:29:47,539 --> 00:29:49,860
Then why didn't you call me?

331
00:29:52,360 --> 00:29:54,880
That day, you were playing on the court.

332
00:29:54,880 --> 00:29:58,059
You looked so bright, so full of life.

333
00:29:58,059 --> 00:29:59,900
And me?

334
00:29:59,900 --> 00:30:02,200
I'd spent over 30 hours in a truck.

335
00:30:02,200 --> 00:30:05,440
I was filthy and stank. How could I face you?

336
00:30:11,340 --> 00:30:13,740
People change their minds.

337
00:30:14,440 --> 00:30:17,200
The more you go through,
the more you overthink things.

338
00:30:17,200 --> 00:30:19,920
I lived on the edge,
always looking over my shoulder.

339
00:30:19,920 --> 00:30:23,100
I got used to living like that.

340
00:30:23,100 --> 00:30:25,960
Back then, I thought...

341
00:30:25,960 --> 00:30:28,800
you'd be better off without me.

342
00:30:35,340 --> 00:30:40,040
When you came back to Teng City,
it felt like a dream.

343
00:30:40,760 --> 00:30:44,960
I wanted to drive you away,
but I also wanted you to stay.

344
00:30:46,800 --> 00:30:52,840
But I knew that whenever you needed me,
I'd always be there with you.

345
00:30:55,760 --> 00:30:57,440
Miao Jing.

346
00:31:00,002 --> 00:31:02,402
I never told you.

347
00:31:03,900 --> 00:31:06,960
I didn't care, and I wasn't sure.

348
00:31:06,960 --> 00:31:08,520
But...

349
00:31:09,740 --> 00:31:11,860
I still want to tell you this.

350
00:31:13,021 --> 00:31:16,225
You're the most special person in my life.

351
00:31:16,225 --> 00:31:18,826
More than anyone, I want you to be happy.

352
00:31:20,100 --> 00:31:25,039
If the most special person,
the one I miss the most,

353
00:31:25,039 --> 00:31:26,920
the one I can never forget,

354
00:31:27,800 --> 00:31:31,380
if all that can be called love,

355
00:31:31,380 --> 00:31:32,920
then--

356
00:31:42,980 --> 00:31:44,880
I love you, too.

357
00:31:55,540 --> 00:31:57,660
It's definitely delicious.

358
00:31:57,660 --> 00:31:59,340
How is it?

359
00:31:59,980 --> 00:32:03,119
Can I make one tiny request?

360
00:32:03,119 --> 00:32:04,740
No.

361
00:32:05,339 --> 00:32:06,620
Does it taste good?

362
00:32:06,620 --> 00:32:09,619
Next time, can you use an insulated lunch box?
It's already cold.

363
00:32:09,619 --> 00:32:11,460
Try it.

364
00:32:49,740 --> 00:32:51,400
Hello.

365
00:32:52,473 --> 00:32:56,340
I'm at the gym with Xiao Yu. I'll be back soon.

366
00:32:56,340 --> 00:32:58,060
Okay.

367
00:32:59,079 --> 00:33:03,140
That clingy? You were apart for one minute,
and he already has to call you?

368
00:33:05,160 --> 00:33:06,839
How did your talk about that go?

369
00:33:06,839 --> 00:33:08,160
What talk?

370
00:33:08,160 --> 00:33:09,859
About getting married.

371
00:33:09,859 --> 00:33:14,759
I'm not pushing you,
but it feels like you should start planning.

372
00:33:14,759 --> 00:33:15,819
I know.

373
00:33:15,819 --> 00:33:20,000
But we just moved to Hai City.
There is still a lot to figure out.

374
00:33:20,000 --> 00:33:21,400
True.

375
00:33:21,400 --> 00:33:25,420
But no matter what, you two have been
through hell, and finally made it.

376
00:33:25,420 --> 00:33:27,319
The future will only get better.

377
00:33:27,319 --> 00:33:30,240
I'll take that blessing.

378
00:33:30,240 --> 00:33:31,380
Let's go.

379
00:33:31,380 --> 00:33:32,420
Let's go.

380
00:33:32,420 --> 00:33:34,240
I'll take you home.

381
00:33:35,480 --> 00:33:37,740
Hi, Jing.

382
00:33:37,740 --> 00:33:39,559
Someone is picking me up.

383
00:33:39,559 --> 00:33:40,900
I'm leaving. Bye.

384
00:33:40,900 --> 00:33:42,240
Go on.

385
00:33:42,240 --> 00:33:44,200
Why are you so late? I've been waiting forever.

386
00:33:44,200 --> 00:33:45,839
Late? I got here early, okay?

387
00:33:45,839 --> 00:33:48,040
- What do you want to eat later?
- Hot pot.

388
00:33:48,040 --> 00:33:51,340
Hot pot? Sure.

389
00:34:07,420 --> 00:34:08,579
What does that mean?

390
00:34:08,579 --> 00:34:10,800
You think I've lost weight?

391
00:34:10,800 --> 00:34:14,780
I just think you've been under too much stress.

392
00:34:20,300 --> 00:34:24,559
I've taken care of the car
and the other stuff from before.

393
00:34:24,559 --> 00:34:30,420
If that's still not enough,
Li Qiao and I have some savings.

394
00:34:32,920 --> 00:34:35,451
Keep it. I have enough money.

395
00:34:36,220 --> 00:34:41,139
You and Li Qiao finally made it to Hai City.
Have fun. Don't worry about all this.

396
00:34:41,139 --> 00:34:42,380
Too bad.

397
00:34:42,380 --> 00:34:45,699
Newlyweds on their honeymoon,
and they still have to bring Yong.

398
00:34:45,699 --> 00:34:47,260
Cut it out.

399
00:34:47,260 --> 00:34:51,239
You think I want to be your third wheel?

400
00:34:51,239 --> 00:34:54,619
- No. I'm here to restock.
- Give me a break. You haven't restocked once.

401
00:34:54,619 --> 00:34:57,800
You just follow me around all day. My God.

402
00:34:57,800 --> 00:34:59,260
I'm not making things up.

403
00:34:59,260 --> 00:35:02,119
Fine. Enjoy your honeymoon,
or do your restocking.

404
00:35:02,119 --> 00:35:04,840
I'll need your help in a couple of days.

405
00:35:10,085 --> 00:35:14,040
Have you dropped any hints to Miao Jing?

406
00:35:14,960 --> 00:35:16,780
What do you mean?

407
00:35:24,900 --> 00:35:27,080
Do I need to?

408
00:35:29,202 --> 00:35:30,960
Tell him.

409
00:35:32,079 --> 00:35:35,340
I don't know. I've never proposed before.

410
00:35:37,679 --> 00:35:39,179
Look.

411
00:35:39,179 --> 00:35:41,940
Some girls like surprises.

412
00:35:41,940 --> 00:35:44,539
Some like everything planned out.

413
00:35:44,539 --> 00:35:48,139
You're single. You don't have much experience.

414
00:35:48,139 --> 00:35:51,800
Think about what Miao Jing would like.

415
00:35:53,139 --> 00:35:56,539
No, I'm not getting it.
Explain it again, in more detail.

416
00:35:56,539 --> 00:35:57,760
You don't need to get it.

417
00:35:57,760 --> 00:36:00,300
Get a girlfriend first.
Then I'll treat you to dinner someday.

418
00:36:00,300 --> 00:36:01,780
- And we'll talk.
- Knock it off.

419
00:36:01,780 --> 00:36:06,080
Here's to my honeymoon.

420
00:36:11,120 --> 00:36:14,060
[Dogged Youth Billiards Training]

421
00:36:27,900 --> 00:36:29,600
Look at this.

422
00:36:29,600 --> 00:36:31,140
Dogged.

423
00:36:31,140 --> 00:36:33,480
What does it mean?

424
00:36:33,480 --> 00:36:34,980
Dog...

425
00:36:34,980 --> 00:36:38,000
- Dog?
- Silly.

426
00:36:38,000 --> 00:36:39,980
Dog is D-O-G.

427
00:36:39,980 --> 00:36:42,300
There's a G-E-D after it.

428
00:36:42,300 --> 00:36:44,019
Put them together: DOGGED.

429
00:36:44,019 --> 00:36:45,679
What does that mean?

430
00:36:45,679 --> 00:36:50,300
I thought E-D meant something
belonged to someone.

431
00:36:50,300 --> 00:36:52,380
- So DOG--
- This pool hall's name

432
00:36:52,380 --> 00:36:55,980
was chosen just for you two.

433
00:36:56,679 --> 00:36:58,320
Dogged.

434
00:36:58,320 --> 00:36:59,940
- "Dog's."
- Very dog-like.

435
00:36:59,940 --> 00:37:01,039
Total dogs.

436
00:37:01,039 --> 00:37:02,380
He's insulting us.

437
00:37:02,380 --> 00:37:05,320
Yeah. He's insulting us.

438
00:37:05,320 --> 00:37:08,039
But the pool hall isn't finished yet.

439
00:37:08,039 --> 00:37:09,940
It's still a little messy.

440
00:37:09,940 --> 00:37:12,660
Leave it to us, Yi. Don't worry.

441
00:37:12,660 --> 00:37:13,780
I'll count on you.

442
00:37:13,780 --> 00:37:15,579
Leave it to us.

443
00:37:15,579 --> 00:37:16,659
Let's get to it!

444
00:37:16,659 --> 00:37:18,380
- I'm waiting for you to say it.
- Let's do it!

445
00:37:18,380 --> 00:37:19,980
Once everything's cleaned up...

446
00:37:19,980 --> 00:37:22,960
have Miao Jing come see the new pool hall.

447
00:37:26,880 --> 00:37:28,980
Hot. It's hot.

448
00:37:39,959 --> 00:37:41,940
How's the soup?

449
00:37:57,820 --> 00:37:59,980
I'm back.

450
00:38:01,139 --> 00:38:02,500
Finally.

451
00:38:02,500 --> 00:38:04,480
I'm exhausted.

452
00:38:07,619 --> 00:38:10,159
Long day, Ms. Miao?

453
00:38:10,159 --> 00:38:12,760
Put a little muscle into it.

454
00:38:12,760 --> 00:38:14,079
Don't look.

455
00:38:14,079 --> 00:38:15,920
What are you watching?

456
00:38:19,880 --> 00:38:22,139
Pork cutlet rice.

457
00:38:22,139 --> 00:38:24,100
You just learned it?

458
00:38:24,100 --> 00:38:25,960
You're making it for me?

459
00:38:25,960 --> 00:38:27,079
For myself.

460
00:38:27,079 --> 00:38:29,020
And?

461
00:38:31,739 --> 00:38:33,179
For Tu Li.

462
00:38:33,179 --> 00:38:37,200
Fine. I'll text Cen Ye and invite him over too.

463
00:38:38,340 --> 00:38:40,280
I'm learning.

464
00:38:42,460 --> 00:38:44,320
I'm exhausted.

465
00:39:06,300 --> 00:39:08,660
I can't sleep.

466
00:39:12,010 --> 00:39:14,320
Try using my arm as your pillow.

467
00:39:28,219 --> 00:39:30,340
I still can't sleep.

468
00:39:33,240 --> 00:39:34,960
You have to get up early tomorrow.

469
00:39:34,960 --> 00:39:37,820
I'll get you some melatonin.

470
00:39:39,260 --> 00:39:40,800
Maybe we should stay up.

471
00:39:40,800 --> 00:39:43,120
It's almost dawn anyway.

472
00:40:17,460 --> 00:40:18,920
You've grown up.

473
00:40:18,920 --> 00:40:21,840
Now you don't even blush or get flustered.

474
00:40:24,519 --> 00:40:28,120
Back then, I was just a kid.
I didn't know any better.

475
00:40:29,099 --> 00:40:31,559
You didn't know any better?

476
00:40:31,559 --> 00:40:33,620
What did you know later that was so great?

477
00:40:38,740 --> 00:40:40,761
What are you laughing at?

478
00:40:41,659 --> 00:40:44,820
It just feels kind of amazing,

479
00:40:44,820 --> 00:40:49,940
like we'd suddenly been given extra time

480
00:40:51,200 --> 00:40:54,960
and suddenly, we grew up

481
00:40:54,960 --> 00:41:00,960
into adults who can stay up if we want
and skip sleep if we want.

482
00:41:03,179 --> 00:41:05,820
Then what do you want to do instead?

483
00:41:25,559 --> 00:41:27,280
Chen Yi.

484
00:41:28,280 --> 00:41:30,900
There's something I want to tell you.

485
00:41:33,480 --> 00:41:36,579
I was going to wait a few days

486
00:41:36,579 --> 00:41:39,739
and take you somewhere prettier,
somewhere more romantic

487
00:41:39,739 --> 00:41:42,100
so I could say this properly.

488
00:41:42,840 --> 00:41:45,180
But I figured it out.

489
00:41:46,240 --> 00:41:48,280
I came back

490
00:41:49,220 --> 00:41:51,180
because of you.

491
00:41:52,040 --> 00:41:57,000
Nothing else matters.
I just want to be with you.

492
00:41:57,000 --> 00:42:00,080
As long as it's you with me.

493
00:42:03,900 --> 00:42:05,580
Chen Yi.

494
00:42:08,579 --> 00:42:10,240
I love you.

495
00:42:11,720 --> 00:42:15,580
I hope you love me too, with all your heart.

496
00:42:16,220 --> 00:42:18,380
Please don't push me away again.

497
00:42:18,380 --> 00:42:21,320
I want you to ask me to stay.

498
00:42:22,200 --> 00:42:24,420
I don't want to be alone anymore.

499
00:42:24,420 --> 00:42:28,579
I want a safe, stable home with you.

500
00:42:30,440 --> 00:42:32,500
Will you?

501
00:42:44,400 --> 00:42:47,400
You still haven't answered my question.

502
00:42:54,380 --> 00:42:56,300
In 2008,

503
00:42:57,640 --> 00:43:00,280
I went to your school to see you.

504
00:43:01,560 --> 00:43:03,880
It was like I finally made peace with it.

505
00:43:05,800 --> 00:43:11,380
I felt like these past twenty years
had been neither great nor terrible.

506
00:43:11,380 --> 00:43:13,980
Everything had finally settled.

507
00:43:13,980 --> 00:43:15,980
And that was not so bad.

508
00:43:21,780 --> 00:43:24,180
Later,

509
00:43:24,180 --> 00:43:27,680
I went back to Teng City
and drifted through life.

510
00:43:30,300 --> 00:43:35,000
I never thought that three years later,
you would come back for me.

511
00:43:36,960 --> 00:43:39,340
I felt like God had been kind to me,

512
00:43:40,760 --> 00:43:43,120
letting me grow up safe,

513
00:43:45,280 --> 00:43:47,560
survive against all odds,

514
00:43:47,560 --> 00:43:53,410
and meet someone I could lean on.

515
00:43:55,380 --> 00:43:57,080
Miao Jing.

516
00:44:00,680 --> 00:44:02,380
I love you.

517
00:44:37,180 --> 00:44:39,000
<i>Look.</i>

518
00:45:47,026 --> 00:45:50,900
Thank you for finding me.

